msgctxt "104"
msgid "Welcome. Have you decided what you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I think you've already had enough to drink. I'd stop now if I were you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Freshen up your drink, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "All right. Please stop by again soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"Yamazaki 25 Years is a single malt whisky created in 1999 to commemorate "
"Suntory's 100-year anniversary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Its long aging process in sherry-wood barrels produces a perfect balance of "
"sweet and bitter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "A mouthful of this divine whisky is pure bliss."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"The price puts it just within reach, as far as \"dream whiskies\" go. I "
"enjoy drinking it on special occasions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Yamazaki is one of Japan's top single malt whiskies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"It's become such a status symbol that whisky aficionados around the world "
"have all heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"They use carefully selected, perfectly matured malts to get that great, "
"smooth flavor. It's popular worldwide, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"This whisky is made at Suntory's Hakushu distillery in Japan's Southern "
"Alps⑬an area famous for its mountain spring water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Its fruity, creamy flavor combined with a distinctly smoky accent makes for "
"a superb drinking experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "I recommend taking the first drink straight up for a pleasantly robust kick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"It goes without saying The Macallan premium malt is the champion of "
"single-malt whiskies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"This 52-year-old whisky made in 1946 wasn't put on the market until the new "
"millennium in 1999."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"The sherry and wood bouquet that are a distinct part of The Macallan "
"whiskies are more subdued, enabling its Islay Malt flavor to shine through."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"They say this was the result of a coal shortage right after World War 2 "
"when more peat was used in the malting process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"This is pricy stuff and extremely rare; however, you can almost taste the "
"history behind it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"The Macallan has a brand new product called Fine Oak, which is a blend of "
"whiskies aged in bourbon and sherry barrels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"But this one here was aged entirely in sherry barrels using the traditional "
"Macallan method."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"The 30-year aging process produces a rich sherry note and a deep sweetness "
"like ripe fruit. There is none of the woody taste of overaging."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"This one's incredibly smooth and it has a freshness you wouldn't expect "
"from a 30-year-old whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "It may be pricey, but one sip and you'll know that it's well worth it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "That's the standard of The Macallan line, aged entirely in sherry barrels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"It's perfect for those looking to enjoy The Macallan without breaking the "
"bank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"It may be the standard of the line, but it's guaranteed to deliver \"The "
"Macallan\" taste!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "I urge you to experience its sweet, full flavor and bouquet for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"The 30-year-old variety is Laphroaig's finest. It has a sweet mellowness "
"from sherry barrels and a boldness from the use of peat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid ""
"Add to this its rich, full-flavored taste, and you have a well-balanced "
"range of flavors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"Even those who find Laphroaig's usual kick a bit overpowering will enjoy "
"the 30-year-old variety."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Its exceptional character has won it many awards for best malt whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "It's safe to say this 10-year Laphroaig is the standard of the line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "It's characterized by an intensely smoky flavor and a smooth, dry body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"It has more than its share of quirks, so most people either love it or hate "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "But if you end up loving this one, it'll be one drink you'll never forget."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"That is the standard of the Bowmore line. Sherry barrels give it its "
"uniquely ripe, floral overtones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"Seaweeds unique to Islay give it a distinctive flavor and saltiness. These "
"qualities have earned it the title \"Queen of Islay.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "It stands a cut above the rest of the single malt 12-year-old whiskies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "The 30-year-old stands at the pinnacle of the Glenfiddich line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"It retains the brand's fruity sweetness while adding a fullness only time "
"can bring. It's a truly special bottle of whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid ""
"Only so many are bottled each year, so it fetches a handsome price on the "
"market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "It hurts the wallet, but excites the taste buds!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "Glenfiddich 12 Years is the best-selling single-malt whisky in the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid ""
"This bottle set the industry standard for a single malt. You'll find it "
"light and fresh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid ""
"The bouquet is fruity and the finish clean, making it exceptionally easy to "
"drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid ""
"Its light flavor makes it popular to women and anyone new to single malt "
"whiskies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"Hibiki 30 Years Old is one of the best whiskies in Japan⑬no, make that the "
"whole world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid ""
"Thirty two years spent mellowing in a Yamazaki white oak barrel gives it a "
"robust taste..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"But don't take my word for it. Take a look at the numerous international "
"awards it has won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid "Only about 2,000 bottles are made each year, making it especially rare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "If you really like whisky, this is the bottle you have to experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid ""
"Hibiki, Japan's premium whisky, is appreciated by whisky snobs all over the "
"world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid ""
"Over thirty types of hand-selected malts are mixed with spirits aged in "
"white oak barrels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid ""
"This produces a mellow flavor that's won first-place titles in "
"international taste tests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid "The finish is particularly good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid ""
"This malt whisky is the result of extensive research into developing the "
"mildest flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid "It really reins in whisky's peculiar taste, making it good for first-timers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1580"
msgid ""
"It's quite enjoyable even to those more accustomed to drinking soju and the "
"like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "The bamboo charcoal filtration it goes through ensures a clean, pure taste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1604"
msgid "It's particularly good mixed with one part water or soda water on the rocks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1664"
msgid "This rectangular bottle is probably the most popular whisky in Japan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1676"
msgid ""
"Some even call it the father of Japanese whisky. Its popularity shows no "
"signs of waning, even after 70 years on the market."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1688"
msgid "It has a sweet aroma, depth, and full body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1700"
msgid ""
"The bottle's shape is so unique, some people ask for the \"square bottle\" "
"when they want this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1760"
msgid "This is another extremely popular Japanese whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1772"
msgid ""
"Spirits aged in sherry barrels at the Yamazaki Distillery are blended with "
"carefully selected malts and grains."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1784"
msgid ""
"This yields a bright aroma and a sweet fullness in the mouth, and the "
"finish is deep and mellow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1796"
msgid ""
"A lot of people call it \"Daruma,\" because the round shape looks like a "
"daruma doll."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1856"
msgid ""
"This bottle sits at the pinnacle of scotch, head and shoulders above the "
"competition."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1868"
msgid ""
"Over thirty different malt spirits have been blended and left to marry for "
"thirty years. It's the king of blended whiskies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1880"
msgid ""
"Thirty years is a long time, and just like a person, it's given this bottle "
"character."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1892"
msgid "The fact that only 2,500 cases are shipped each year makes it quite rare."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1952"
msgid "That right there's the ultimate blended whisky."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1964"
msgid ""
"It boasts a flavor and aroma that can be created only by combining over "
"forty single malts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1976"
msgid ""
"This could very well be called the crown jewel of Ballantine's "
"whisky-blending skill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1988"
msgid ""
"It's well loved around the world to the point of some calling\r\n"
"it \"the scotch.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2048"
msgid ""
"This is a standard scotch, made from a blend of over forty varieties of "
"single malts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2060"
msgid "Not too heavy, not too light. It's got a great balance to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2072"
msgid ""
"And the price isn't too heavy, either. I'd recommend it to casual scotch "
"drinkers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2084"
msgid ""
"It also makes for a nice segue into blended whiskies if you've never tried "
"one before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2144"
msgid "Jack Daniel's is the face of American whiskey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2156"
msgid "A simple, clear taste and mellow, warm aroma are its defining features."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2168"
msgid ""
"To qualify as a Tennessee whiskey, it needs to be made in Tennessee and use "
"a special charcoal mellowing process."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2180"
msgid "And that's not an easy designation to earn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2192"
msgid "Still, most people seem to consider it a bourbon for whatever reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2252"
msgid "People have been loving Early Times since the day it came out in 1860."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2264"
msgid "It's practically synonymous with bourbon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2276"
msgid ""
"The flavor is very American⑬silky to the tongue but with a sharp, clean "
"finish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2288"
msgid "The modest price also makes it a wonderful choice for a casual drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2348"
msgid "This is a mature, 100％ grape brandy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2360"
msgid ""
"It's got that rich, dense brandy flavor and bouquet you can really sink "
"your teeth into."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2372"
msgid "The finish is wonderful, too. I often drink this at home myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2384"
msgid ""
"Drink it straight or on the rocks, cut it with water, cut it with tonic... "
"This is the only brandy you'll ever need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2444"
msgid ""
"A remarkable specimen from France, Courvoisier XO won top prize in "
"worldwide cognac tests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2456"
msgid ""
"The pairing of the finest grapes with Borderies spirits produces a full but "
"smooth palate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2468"
msgid "You haven't truly had cognac until you've tried this one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2528"
msgid ""
"The Premium Malt's won Japan's first world title and then kept the title "
"for the next two years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2540"
msgid "It's a premium beer by Japanese or even world standards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2552"
msgid ""
"Unbending commitment to ensure the best ingredients and Suntory's years of "
"brewing know-how produced a delicious, almost magical flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2564"
msgid "I must say, it's a thing of beauty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2576"
msgid ""
"A frosty glass of The Premium Malt's while nibbling sashimi or enjoying a "
"Blu-ray movie on your day off... Ah... That's the life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2636"
msgid ""
"Carlsberg is one of the world's favorite beers, loved by folks in 140 "
"countries around the globe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2648"
msgid "Carlsberg ordinarily brews lager beers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2660"
msgid ""
"But their Japanese-licensed brewer, Suntory, created Carlsberg's first "
"draft beer using their own special techniques."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2672"
msgid ""
"Together, they've created Carlsberg's first draft beer. You'll only see "
"this here in Japan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2684"
msgid "It has an impressively clean taste that goes well with all sorts of food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2744"
msgid "That's a prime example of Korean soju."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2756"
msgid ""
"A spring-water base gives it a clean taste, while premium Korean barley "
"gives it a mellow, rounded feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2768"
msgid "It's quite affordable, too. I'd give it an A+ for cost performance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2780"
msgid ""
"I used to drink this all the time, and its taste is still as familiar as an "
"old friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2792"
msgid "It's even better now, thanks to those fond memories."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2852"
msgid ""
"Like Tenryugura, this awamori is produced at the oldest surviving maker in "
"Shuri, Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2864"
msgid ""
"It has the unique flavor of awamori along with a bright, light aroma and a "
"clean, crisp taste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2876"
msgid ""
"Straight up, on the rocks, or even cut with hot or cold water⑬you can't go "
"wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2888"
msgid "It also goes well with soda water, or use fruit juice for a livelier mix."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2948"
msgid ""
"Like Churajima, this awamori is produced at the oldest maker in Shuri still "
"in business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2960"
msgid ""
"Tenryugura is born of only the best spirits that have been left to slowly "
"age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2972"
msgid ""
"Although its alcohol content is 30％, it has a smooth feel in the mouth, a "
"vanilla-like aroma, and a full flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2984"
msgid ""
"I recommend taking your first sip straight so you can enjoy the full flavor "
"of this aged gem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27352"
msgid "Bartender"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27356"
msgid "Talk_Ojigi"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "27360"
msgid "dummy"
msgstr ""